<!-- Vendored from osinfo-db git main, commit a018d7fec08547758ee64cc08d22c9f75b4fedbd
     ("fedora: Add Fedora 44", 2026-05-04): data/os/fedoraproject.org/fedora-44.xml.in

     Fedora 44 shipped 2026-04-26, but the newest tagged osinfo-db release is still
     20251212, which knows fedora42 and fedora43 and stops there. No dnf update fixes
     this on any Fedora, so libvirt, virt-install and cockpit-machines on this host
     cannot resolve the fedora44 short-id without help.

     /etc/osinfo is libosinfo's local database directory; entries here merge with the
     RPM-owned /usr/share/osinfo, so this file conflicts with no package.

     The upstream .xml.in needs no transformation: it carries no gettext-marked
     elements, only the translations that the osinfo-db build would add.

     Remove this file once osinfo-db tags a release containing fedora-44. -->
